1
00:00:06,710 --> 00:00:10,400
We are succeeding in minimizing 
the attacks against our transport trains.

2
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:12,820
As well as dominating the marketplace.

3
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:15,350
The MCA lacks the Wisdom of the Shadows,

4
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:18,900
so their attempts to supply paper money 
and create credit will be more than they can handle.

5
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:20,380
If these circumstances continue,

6
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:23,790
I believe they will be crushed 
under the weight of their own ambition.

7
00:00:23,790 --> 00:00:25,210
Just as we predicted.

8
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:27,600
But remember, as I'm sure you know...

9
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:33,000
We will not take any action that would implicate 
Mitsugoshi having a connection to Shadow Garden.

10
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,440
Of course, that will force us 
to rely on passive measures...

11
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:40,050
It only takes a moment 
for trust to be broken.

12
00:00:40,050 --> 00:00:43,590
We must devote the utmost care 
to maintaining it.

13
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:45,300
Surely he taught you that, as well.

14
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:46,250
Indeed.

15
00:00:46,250 --> 00:00:49,300
For now, we must refrain from 
any brash behavior.

16
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:52,650
I beg your pardon.

17
00:00:53,090 --> 00:00:54,500
But we have guests.

18
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:58,510
Unlike Garter Kikuchi, 
it seems this man has little patience.

19
00:00:58,510 --> 00:00:59,850
He's young.

20
00:01:00,110 --> 00:01:03,350
He can't suppress his warrior... 
or rather, his therianthrope nature.

21
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,170
In any case, Nu...

22
00:01:05,170 --> 00:01:07,130
I know it's late, but treat our guests 
with the proper—

23
00:01:07,130 --> 00:01:08,300
Lady Alpha...

24
00:01:09,380 --> 00:01:11,770
Please allow me to handle this.

25
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:12,720
What?

26
00:01:13,020 --> 00:01:13,710
What?

27
00:01:17,710 --> 00:01:19,090
In any case, Nu...

28
00:01:19,090 --> 00:01:21,130
I know it's late, but treat our guests 
with the proper—

29
00:01:21,130 --> 00:01:22,350
Lady Alpha...

30
00:01:22,750 --> 00:01:25,060
Please allow me to handle this.

31
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:28,090
You?

32
00:01:28,710 --> 00:01:29,710
Yes, Lady Alpha.

33
00:01:29,710 --> 00:01:32,000
I will teach our visitors a lesson.

34
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,590
Really...

35
00:01:33,590 --> 00:01:35,800
You two, go with her.

36
00:01:40,310 --> 00:01:41,980
Well, I'm sure it'll be fine.

37
00:01:42,340 --> 00:01:44,590
She is seventeen years old, after all.

38
00:01:44,590 --> 00:01:45,500
What?

39
